---
// src/components/AboutBrand.astro
// High-End Editorial Story & Values with Double-Bezel Enclosures
---

<!-- ==================== CERITA & KETENTERAMAN (TENTANG PROPERTI & SYARIAH) ==================== -->
<section class="py-24 sm:py-32 bg-surface-canvas border-b border-border-stone scroll-mt-20 relative overflow-hidden" id="tentang">
  
  <!-- Subtle Ambient Glows -->
  <div class="absolute top-12 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-syariah-gold/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-10 -left-20 w-96 h-96 bg-primary/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 xs:px-6 lg:px-10 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start relative">
      
      <!-- Sisi Kiri: Sticky Double-Bezel Brand Card (5 Cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:sticky lg:top-[max(6.5rem,calc(50vh-220px))] lg:self-start transition-all">
        <div class="p-2 sm:p-2.5 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-stone-200/40 ring-1 ring-stone-300/60 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.03)]">
          <div class="p-7 sm:p-9 rounded-[calc(2.5rem-0.5rem)] bg-white shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.9)] flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <!-- Micro Eyebrow Badge -->
              <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-syariah-gold/10 border border-syariah-gold/30 text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary font-semibold mb-4">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-syariah-gold animate-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span>Nilai Dasar &amp; Filosofi Hunian</span>
              </div>

              <!-- Main Editorial Heading -->
              <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl xs:text-3xl sm:text-[2rem] lg:text-[2.2rem] font-normal leading-[1.25] text-on-surface tracking-tight">
                Nyaman, Bersih, dan Sesuai Syariah.
              </h2>

              <!-- Elegant Gold Divider Line -->
              <div class="w-16 h-0.5 bg-syariah-gold/60 my-5 sm:my-6"></div>

              <!-- Story Narrative -->
              <div class="space-y-4 text-on-surface-variant text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed font-sans">
                <p>
                  Penginapan syariah di kawasan Banguntapan yang mengutamakan adab, kebersihan, dan ketenangan istirahat keluarga.
                </p>
                <p class="text-on-surface-variant/90">
                  Hanya <strong class="text-on-surface font-semibold">6 kamar tidur</strong> — memastikan suasana tetap hening, tertib, dan bebas dari hiruk-pikuk keramaian umum.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Authentic Property Reassurance Footer -->
            <div class="mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-border-stone/60 text-[11px] font-mono text-on-surface-variant flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-medium text-primary">Ramah Keluarga &amp; Akademisi</span>
              <span class="text-syariah-gold-dark font-semibold">Banguntapan, Bantul</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sisi Kanan: 3 Double-Bezel Pillar Cards (7 Cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-6 sm:gap-7">
        
        <!-- Pilar 01: Syariah & Adab -->
        <div class="p-2 sm:p-2.5 rounded-[2.25rem] bg-stone-200/40 ring-1 ring-stone-300/60 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.03)] hover:shadow-[0_24px_48px_-12px_rgba(40,54,43,0.12)] hover:ring-syariah-gold/30 hover:bg-syariah-gold/5 transition-all duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.32,0.72,0,1)] hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-[calc(2.25rem-0.5rem)] bg-white shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.9)] flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-surface-subtle border border-border-stone text-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-2xs">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]" aria-hidden="true">verified_user</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-primary font-semibold bg-primary-light px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Prinsip &amp; Adab</span>
                </div>
                <span class="font-mono text-xl font-medium text-primary-deep/80" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
              </div>

              <h3 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl font-medium text-on-surface mt-1">
                Lingkungan Tertib: Pasutri Sah, Keluarga &amp; Tamu Sejenis
              </h3>
              
              <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">
                Menyambut tamu Muslim maupun Non-Muslim dengan prinsip adab yang terjaga. Kami menerima tamu keluarga, pasutri sah (dengan identitas/akta nikah resmi), serta tamu single/rombongan sesama jenis dalam satu kamar (pria semua atau wanita semua). Lingkungan 100% bebas rokok di kamar, bebas miras, dan narkoba.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-border-stone/60 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-primary font-medium">
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-primary" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span>
                Amanah, santun &amp; tertib
              </span>
              <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-medium">Privasi Terlindungi</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pilar 02: Ketenangan 6 Kamar -->
        <div class="p-2 sm:p-2.5 rounded-[2.25rem] bg-stone-200/40 ring-1 ring-stone-300/60 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.03)] hover:shadow-[0_24px_48px_-12px_rgba(40,54,43,0.12)] hover:ring-syariah-gold/30 hover:bg-syariah-gold/5 transition-all duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.32,0.72,0,1)] hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-[calc(2.25rem-0.5rem)] bg-white shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.9)] flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-surface-subtle border border-border-stone text-secondary-dark flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-2xs">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]" aria-hidden="true">night_shelter</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary-dark font-semibold bg-surface-subtle px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-border-stone">Ketenangan Optimal</span>
                </div>
                <span class="font-mono text-xl font-medium text-secondary-dark" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
              </div>

              <h3 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl font-medium text-on-surface mt-1">
                Hanya 6 Kamar Tidur, Hening &amp; Jauh dari Kebisingan
              </h3>
              
              <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">
                Bukan hotel massal ratusan tamu. Skala properti yang privat memberikan ketenangan optimal untuk istirahat malam yang pulas, aman bagi lansia dan anak-anak.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-border-stone/60 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-secondary-dark font-medium">
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-secondary-dark" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span>
                Tanpa kerumunan orang asing
              </span>
              <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-medium">Tidur Tenang &amp; Nyenyak</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pilar 03: Keramahan Tuan Rumah -->
        <div class="p-2 sm:p-2.5 rounded-[2.25rem] bg-stone-200/40 ring-1 ring-stone-300/60 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.03)] hover:shadow-[0_24px_48px_-12px_rgba(40,54,43,0.12)] hover:ring-syariah-gold/30 hover:bg-syariah-gold/5 transition-all duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.32,0.72,0,1)] hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-[calc(2.25rem-0.5rem)] bg-white shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.9)] flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl bg-surface-subtle border border-border-stone text-syariah-gold-dark flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-2xs">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]" aria-hidden="true">handshake</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-syariah-gold-dark font-semibold bg-gold-subtle/50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-syariah-gold/30">Sentuhan Personal</span>
                </div>
                <span class="font-mono text-xl font-medium text-syariah-gold-dark" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
              </div>

              <h3 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl font-medium text-on-surface mt-1">
                Pelayanan Hangat &amp; Kekeluargaan Bu Agnesia
              </h3>
              
              <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">
                Komunikasi langsung dengan pengelola properti. Respon WhatsApp cepat dan ramah untuk koordinasi check-in, petunjuk rute, hingga rekomendasi kuliner Jogja.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-border-stone/60 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-syariah-gold-dark font-semibold">
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px] text-syariah-gold-dark" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span>
                Respon cepat &amp; komunikatif
              </span>
              <span class="text-on-surface-variant font-medium">Serasa di Rumah Kerabat</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
